	(text "AA battery module (spec section 3): passive. 4 x AA NiMH in series (alkaline tolerated), one PTC in the pack lead.\nLine shift: this module's pack leaves upwards on PACK1; PACK1-PACK4 arriving from the modules below leave as PACK2-PACK5;\na sixth module's pack ends here. So the hub input number is the module's position counted from the hub, 5 = lowest.\nChain 2x8 is reversal-safe (pin k meets pin 17-k). GND and AUX_5V pass straight through. Holder footprint (BC4AAPC) at M2."
